---
import examples from '../../../lib/relational-collection/search-examples.json';
const vectors=examples.toy_vectors.products;
const x=(n)=>70+n*290;const y=(n)=>255-n*185;
---
<figure class="r56-geometry" data-r56-geometry aria-labelledby="r56-geometry-title">
 <figcaption id="r56-geometry-title"><span>Figure 1</span> The closest point may be ineligible</figcaption>
 <p class="note">Chosen two-dimensional coordinates · Euclidean distance · no embedding model or semantic axis</p>
 <svg viewBox="0 0 440 320" role="img" aria-label="P7 and the query coincide at 0,1. P9 at 0.6,0.8 is nearer than P3 at1,0. P7 is out of stock.">
  <path d="M70 45V255H385" class="axis"/><path d="M70 70L244 107 M70 70L360 255" class="distance"/>
  <text x="63" y="279">0</text><text x="44" y="73">1</text><text x="356" y="279">1</text><text x="235" y="309">Coordinate 1</text><text x="15" y="25">Coordinate 2</text>
  <circle cx={x(vectors.P7[0])} cy={y(vectors.P7[1])} r="12" class="query"/><circle cx={x(vectors.P7[0])} cy={y(vectors.P7[1])} r="4" class="point"/>
  <text x="91" y="54" class="label">Query = P7 [0, 1]</text><text x="91" y="76">P7 stock: 0</text>
  <circle cx={x(vectors.P9[0])} cy={y(vectors.P9[1])} r="5" class="point"/><text x="257" y="113" class="label">P9 [0.6, 0.8]</text>
  <circle cx={x(vectors.P3[0])} cy={y(vectors.P3[1])} r="5" class="point"/><text x="265" y="242" class="label">P3 [1, 0]</text>
 </svg>
 <p class="stage" data-live data-stage></p><p class="result" data-live data-result></p><p class="explanation" data-live data-explanation aria-live="polite"></p>
 <div class="controls"><fieldset><legend>Request: nearest one in-stock product</legend><label><input type="radio" name="r56-filter" value="inside" checked /> Stock filter inside retrieval</label><label><input type="radio" name="r56-filter" value="outside" /> Limit first, stock filter outside</label></fieldset><div class="buttons"><button type="button" data-play>Play</button><button type="button" data-back>Back</button><button type="button" data-next>Next</button><button type="button" data-reset>Reset</button><span data-step aria-label="Step"></span></div><div data-hold class="hold" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div></div>
 <details><summary>The geometry and both queries, as text</summary><p>The query is [0,1]. P7 is at the same point, distance 0; P9 [0.6,0.8] is about 0.6325 away; P3 [1,0] is about 1.4142 away. P7 has no stock after order 103. Filtering eligibility inside the exact retrieval query makes P9 the nearest returned product. Taking one nearest product globally first chooses P7, then the outer stock filter removes it and returns no rows. The coordinates are chosen examples, not generated embeddings or evidence that a teapot answers a shopper’s request.</p></details>
</figure>
<script>
 import {stepper} from '../../figures/stepper.mjs';
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-r56-geometry]').forEach(root=>{
  const player=stepper(root,{steps:()=>4,draw:n=>{
   const inside=root.querySelector('input:checked').value==='inside';
   root.querySelector('[data-stage]').textContent=['Distances: P7 = 0 · P9 ≈ 0.6325 · P3 ≈ 1.4142',inside?'Eligible set: P9 and P3':'Global nearest one: P7',inside?'Nearest eligible one: P9':'Outer stock filter removes P7',inside?'Exact filtered order: P9, then P3':'P9 was never in the limited candidate set'][n];
   root.querySelector('[data-result]').textContent=n<3?'Final result pending':inside?'Returned: P9':'Returned: no rows';
   root.querySelector('[data-explanation]').textContent=(inside?[
    'The distance calculation has no knowledge of availability. P7 is closest because its chosen vector equals the query vector.',
    'The stock predicate excludes P7. Both remaining products belong to the eligible set searched by this query.',
    'P9 is closer than P3 under Euclidean distance. LIMIT 1 chooses it from the eligible set.',
    'The query returns P9. That is an exact geometric answer; these invented coordinates provide no evidence of semantic relevance.'
   ]:[
    'The same exact distance calculation is used. Changing the nesting of the query will change which set LIMIT sees.',
    'The inner query takes the globally nearest product before testing stock. That product is P7.',
    'The outer query sees only P7, which has stock 0. It cannot reach back into the inner scan to retrieve P9.',
    'The result is empty even though two eligible products exist. This is a query-set mistake, independent of approximate indexing.'
   ])[n];
  }});root.querySelectorAll('input').forEach(input=>input.addEventListener('change',()=>player.render()));
 });
</script>
<style>
.r56-geometry{margin:2.5rem 0;font:.9rem/1.5 var(--font-sans)}figcaption{font:1.2rem/1.4 var(--font-serif);margin-bottom:.8rem}figcaption>span{font:.75rem var(--font-sans);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-right:.6rem}.note{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}svg{width:100%;max-width:38rem;display:block;margin:1rem auto}svg text{fill:var(--color-text-secondary);font:13px var(--font-sans)}svg .label{fill:var(--color-text);font-weight:600}.axis{fill:none;stroke:var(--color-text-secondary)}.distance{fill:none;stroke:var(--color-text-secondary);stroke-dasharray:5 5}.query{fill:none;stroke:var(--color-accent);stroke-width:3}.point{fill:var(--color-text)}.stage{min-height:3rem}.result{font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding-bottom:.7rem}.explanation{min-height:7rem;border-left:3px solid var(--color-accent);padding-left:1rem}.controls{padding:1rem;background:var(--color-surface-alt);border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary)}fieldset{border:0;padding:0;margin:0 0 1rem;display:grid;gap:.6rem}legend{font-size:.85rem;margin-bottom:.5rem}label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem}.buttons{display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}button{font:inherit;color:var(--color-text);background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding:.45rem .65rem;border-radius:.25rem;cursor:pointer}button[aria-disabled=true]{opacity:.55}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--color-accent);outline-offset:3px}.hold{height:3px;margin-top:.6rem;background:var(--color-surface)}.hold span{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:var(--color-accent)}details{margin-top:.8rem}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--color-accent)}@media(max-width:550px){.explanation{min-height:10rem}svg text{font-size:18px}}
</style>
